n\n### Issue description\n\nWith the bugfix brought by #118651, which re-enabled the shrinking of expanding `Label` and `TabBar` nodes (which was new and messed up in #116640), came a limitation reported by KoBeWi. \nIf you have a `Label`, which has some autowrapping mode enabled, you can now shrink its width, and if you do not have clipping or overrun enabled, the text will just overflow instead of wrapping around:\n\n<img width=\"630\" height=\"103\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b5456b23-665a-4a13-840b-2b3fc8fb0dc4\" />\n\nIdeally, the node would expand its height upon width shrinkage such that it would fit all of the text by wrapping it, based on the selected autowrap mode.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Add `Label`\n* Give the label a custom maximum width\n* Enable autowrap (any mode)\n* Type in text\n  * -> The `Label` will grow horizontally to fit it \n* Shrink the width\n  * -> Problem\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[no-clip-label-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27499763/no-clip-label-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","s